{"id":"mve7ubk6-4e83fu","dreamId":"mve7ubj2-f3ne9z","season":1,"number":1,"stage":1,"title":"After the Wanting","revision":1,"writtenAt":"2026-10-18T19:26:00.966Z","source":"migrated-v1","wovenProofId":null,"opening":{"morning":{"key":"p0","fragmentId":"v1:op9","beat":"opening","text":"No scramble, no dread, no list running before your feet touch the floor. Just morning, and you, and the life that answered.","spans":[]},"evening":{"key":"p0","fragmentId":"v1:op9","beat":"opening","text":"No scramble, no dread, no list running before your feet touch the floor. Just morning, and you, and the life that answered.","spans":[]}},"body":[{"key":"p1","fragmentId":"v1:ar-ab6","beat":"arrival","text":"You tip well. You book the trip. You breathe. Enough stopped being a ceiling and became a floor: A home by the sea.","spans":[]},{"key":"p2","fragmentId":"v1:se10","beat":"sensory","text":"Your own handwriting in the margin of today's list looks different lately. Rounder. Unclenched.","spans":[]},{"key":"p3","fragmentId":"v1:li-ab3","beat":"living","text":"An opportunity lands in your inbox — the paid kind, the aligned kind. They find you regularly now, like the address finally got listed.","spans":[]},{"key":"p4","fragmentId":"v1:wi7","beat":"living","text":"Someone younger watches how you move through the day and quietly adjusts their own sails. You remember being them. You'd have loved proof like you.","spans":[]},{"key":"p5","fragmentId":"v1:gr1","beat":"reflection","text":"Gratitude arrives on its own now, uninvited, mid-afternoon — for the ordinary furniture of a life you once begged the sky for.","spans":[]}],"closing":{"morning":{"key":"p6","fragmentId":"v1:cl6","beat":"closing","text":"Sleep takes you gently, the way it takes people with nothing to flee. Tomorrow will rhyme with today. That's the whole plan now.","spans":[]},"evening":{"key":"p6","fragmentId":"v1:cl6","beat":"closing","text":"Sleep takes you gently, the way it takes people with nothing to flee. Tomorrow will rhyme with today. That's the whole plan now.","spans":[]}},"wordCount":{"morning":151,"evening":151},"engineVersion":1}